{{#is_alert}}
IRIS instance {{host.name}} is consuming {{value}} percent of its licensed capacity. New connections and jobs will be refused once the license is fully consumed. Release idle sessions or raise the licensed capacity.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
License usage on IRIS instance {{host.name}} has reached {{value}} percent of licensed capacity. It has not yet crossed the critical threshold, but headroom for new connections is shrinking.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_recovery}}
License usage on IRIS instance {{host.name}} has fallen back to a safe level and the instance has licensed capacity available again.
{{/is_recovery}}
